  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 24,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "8",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2CO 8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "8",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi dinu enu ana kwetu, hitukuyileja luwi lwaNzambi lwanenkuwu kuyipompelu yamuMasidoniya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Luwi lwakwila, iku adi nakuyitompa nankashi nalukadi, hela neyi aswejeli wuzweŋi, hiyakutiya muzaŋalu wakuhana mahetawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa ami nukutwesha kushimunamu nami ahanini chakunyichima yawu mwatwesheluwu, hela chakubadika mwatwesheleluwu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakutulembelela nakulembelela kwakweni nawu ayiteji kukundaŋana nawu nakukwasha akwakujila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayi mutwakuhweleleli etu hohuku, ásambilili dehi kudi hana kudi Mwanta awenawu, nikudetu nawa chakumuchima waNzambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi hitukumushinjila Titusa, netu amanishi mudenu iwu mudimu waluwi watachikiliyi dehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ichi chimuneli munabadiki dehi muyuma yejima, nimukukuhwelela, nimukuhosha, nimukwiluka, nimukusweja Ŋovu, nimukukeŋa kumwatukeŋaŋa, netu badikenu nimuluwi ilu nawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hitunayileji chalushimbuku, ilaŋa chinamoni Ŋovu jawantu amakwawu jinasweji, natoŋojoki nami nitompi nachu kukeŋa kwenu nawa, nimoni neyi kwalala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muneluki luwi lwaMwanta wetu Yesu Kristu, lwakwila hela wadiŋi waheta, hakwikala kazweŋi kukoolenu, kulonda kuwuzweŋi windi enu mwakekali aheta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukuyileja munatoŋojokeli nsaŋu iyi, nami, chinawahi kumanisha chuma chimwatachikili kwila munahiti dehi mwaka, nikukeŋa kwilamu nawa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kulonda muchima wakukeŋa kwila wesekani nakumanisha kwila, mwesekela yuma yimudi nayu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa neyi kudi muchima wakuhana, akutambula mwahetelayi muntu, bayi mwabulilayuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinalondi nami antu amakwawu atiyi kuwaha enu mutiyilumu kukalaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinsaŋuyakwesekana. Yuma yenu yayivulu yakatataka, yikwashi akwenu mwonsu mwanabuluwu, kulonda yuma yawu yayivulu yakakwashi enu himwakabuli nawa, kulonda chakesekani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anasoneki mumukanda wajila nawu, Muntu wakuŋwili yayivulu hiyamuswejeleluku; muntu wakuŋwili yantesha hiyamukeheleluku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tumusakililenu Nzambi washili mumuchima waTitusa chakuyakama mwenimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa hakuminini dakwitiya mutwakeŋa eli etu hohuku, yomwenindi waswejeli kutiya kuwaha kwinza kudenu chakumuchima windi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tunamutemeshi chimu namana kwetu watiyakana dehi muyipompelu yejima, nawu wasweja kushimuna osaŋu yayiwahi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hidimu hohu bweŋuku, niakwayipompelu anamukunjiki kuya nanetu mumudimu iwu waluwi wutukwila, kulonda Mwanta alemi, kulonda kumwekesha nachu muchima wetu wakukeŋa kwila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tunachini kutwinka muloŋa wansaŋu jachenichi chamukunkulu chitukutwala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Twalondaŋa yuma yalumbuluka kumesu aMwanta ni kumesu awantu nawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tunayitemeshi chimu namana kwetu itunatompi dehi kakavulu, netu washaŋa muchima kunsaŋu jajivulu, katataka nabadiki dehi, muloŋa nasweji dehi kuyikuhwelelenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi akwihula nsaŋu yaTitusa, diyi mukwetu nadikwashaŋa nindi mudimu wakuyikalakelenu; ninowu ana kwetu nawa, hiyantemesha ayipompelu, dimu mwalemenayi Kristu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi mwckeshenu kukeŋa kwenu muyipompelu, nanichi chitwadisambaŋa hansaŋu yenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
